                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "Szulewski, A., Gegenfurtner, A., Howes, D. W., Sivilotti, M. L., & van Merriënboer, J. J. (2017). Measuring physician cognitive load: validity evidence for a physiologic and a psychometric tool. Advances in Health Sciences Education, 22(4), 951-968."
